@pass Poison I, about 10 s (4 + 3 x 2); unoxidized armor: never
@fails `CopperPoisoningHandler` (persistent key `ce_copper_poison_roll`), `isOxidized` NBT check
@reviewed 2026-11-16
@from batches/r1031/a1_effects.qb
