## SQ-EFX-16 | capped effect stored at level I; uncapped one keeps its level
@group A
@commands `/effect give <bot> minecraft:fire_resistance 30 2`; `/effect give <bot> minecraft:speed 30 2`; `/data get entity <bot> ActiveEffects`
@pass Fire Resistance (Id 12) at Amplifier 0b; Speed (Id 1) at Amplifier 2b
@fails `LivingEntityEffectRemapMixin` cap line, or `levelCaps` not read (config not loaded)
@reviewed 2026-11-24
