sleep 3
> effect clear qe
> effect give qe minecraft:fire_resistance 30 2
> effect give qe minecraft:speed 30 2
> data get entity qe ActiveEffects
expect Id: 12, Amplifier: 0b
expect Id: 1, Amplifier: 2b
> effect clear qe
## SQ-EFX-17 | a higher capped level does not cut a longer duration
@group A
@commands `/effect give <bot> minecraft:fire_resistance 60 0`, then `/effect give <bot> minecraft:fire_resistance 5 2`; `/data get entity <bot> ActiveEffects`
@pass Fire Resistance Amplifier 0b with Duration above 1000 (the 60 s one kept)
@fails `update()` cap missing: Duration near 100 means the level III replaced the longer level I
@reviewed 2026-11-24
> execute unless entity qe run pbot spawn qe -50 -60 -50 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> effect clear qe
> effect give qe minecraft:fire_resistance 60 0
> effect give qe minecraft:fire_resistance 5 2
> data get entity qe ActiveEffects
expect Id: 12, Amplifier: 0b
look Duration about 1180 (60 s less the ticks since); about 100 is the failure
> effect clear qe
